    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jwamkongwe jwa ku Shunemu akuwujila soni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamsalile jwamkongwe juŵamjimucisye mwanace jwakwe juŵawile jula kuti, “Mtyoce akuno pamo ni ŵandu ŵa mwiŵasa mwenu, mkatame nawo kulikose kutimsose kuja kutama, pakuŵa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tapelece sala ja yaka msano ni yiŵili pa cilambo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.8+2KI.4.9+2KI.4.10+2KI.4.11+2KI.4.12+2KI.4.13+2KI.4.14+2KI.4.15+2KI.4.16+2KI.4.17+2KI.4.18+2KI.4.19+2KI.4.20+2KI.4.21+2KI.4.22+2KI.4.23+2KI.4.24+2KI.4.25+2KI.4.26+2KI.4.27+2KI.4.28+2KI.4.29+2KI.4.30+2KI.4.31+2KI.4.32+2KI.4.33+2KI.4.34+2KI.4.35+2KI.4.36+2KI.4.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 4:8-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamkongwe jula ŵapikanile yiŵamsalile Elisha yila. Ŵatyosile pamo ni ŵandu ŵa mwiŵasa mwakwe, ni ŵajile kutama nawo ku cilambo ca Afilisiti kwa yaka msano ni yiŵili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yili yimasile yaka msano ni yiŵiliyo, jwamkongwejo pamo ni liŵasa lyakwe ŵawujile kumangwakwe ku Isalaeli. Ali ayice kumangwakweko ŵajawile kwa mwenye kuja kuŵenda kuti amwucisye nyumba ni mgunda ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayice kwa mwenye, ŵasimene mwenyewo ali mkuŵecetana ni Gehasi, mcanda jwakutumicila jwa Elisha, ŵaliji mkumwusya kuti amsalile ya yindu yakusimonjeka yayikulungwakulungwa yiŵayitesile Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jelejo Gehasi ŵamsalilaga jwalakwejo yiŵatite Elisha pakumjimusya mwanace jwamlume jwam'we, ni kola soni umi, jwamkongwe jula ni mwanace jwakwe jwamlume jula ŵayice pa malopo. Nipo Gehasi ŵatite kwa mwenye, “Ŵalakwe Ambuje, mwanace jwamlume juŵamjimwisye Elisha ku ŵawe jula ni aju, nipo mamagwe ni aŵa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye piŵamwusisye jwamkongwejo ya jele nganiji, jwalakwejo ŵatendele umboni kuti kweli Elisha, ŵamjimwisye mwanace jwakwe jwamlume ku ŵawe. Nipo mwenye ŵajiŵilasile nduna jakwe ni ŵajisalile kuti, mlolecesye kuti, jwamkongweju apegwe yindu yosope yiyaliji yakwe, kupwatika mbiya syakwe syosope, sisyapatikene pakusumisya mbeju sya mu mgunda mwakwe, citandilile ndaŵi jiŵatyosile mcilambo acino ca Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha ni Mwenye Beni Hadadi jwa ku Siliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line Elisha ŵajawile ku Damasiko, ndaŵi jelejo Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya waliji mkulwala. Mwenyejo ali apikene kuti Elisha jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa Mlungu ayice, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵamsalile Hasaele, jumo jwa nduna syakwe kuti, “Mjigale mtuka ni mkasimane najo Elisha mundu jwakulocesyajo, nipo jwalakwejo akawusye AMBUJE naga une timbe cenene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Hasaele ŵajawile kuja kusimana ni Elisha jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu, ali asitwicile ngamila",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " 40 ni yindu yambone yakupanganyidwa ku Damasiko ni mtuka wakuja kumpa Elisha. Piŵajile kwika, ŵajile kwima pameso pa Elisha, jwakulocesya jula, ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Jwakutumicila jwa Mwenye Beni Hadadi, jwa ku Siliya, andumile kuti nawusye ŵalakwe kuti, ana taŵe cenene?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamjanjile Hasaele kuti, “AMBUJE andosisye une kuti jwalakwejo tawe, nambo m'mwejo mjawule mkamsalile kuti tatame cenene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali amasile kuŵeceta gele maloŵega, Elisha ŵamlolecesye Hasaele, nipo Hasaelejo ŵajasile mtima. Papopo Elisha ŵatandite kulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Hasaele ŵamwusisye Elisha kuti, “Ana ambuje, ligongo cici akulila?” Jwalakwejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Une ngumanyilila yindu yakusakala yitimcatendela ŵandu ŵa Isalaeli. Timcajocela misinda jawo ja ngondo, nipo timcawulaga asilikali ŵawo ŵa ngondo ŵajinji. Timciswanya mitwe ja ŵanace ŵawo, timcatumbulanya acakongwe ŵawo ŵakwete yilu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasaele ŵamwusisye Elisha kuti, “Ana yikomboleka uli une kutenda yindu ya mtundu welewo? Pakuŵa uneji ndili mundu jwakutumicila cabe, jwangali macili gakutendela yindu yakogoya yamti myiyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵajanjile kuti, “AMBUJE asalile une kuti m'mwejo timciŵa mwenye jwa ku Siliya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Hasaele ŵawujile kwa ambujegwe Beni Hadadi ku Siliya. Ambujegwewo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana Elisha amsalilile cici?” Hasaele ŵajanjile kuti, “Elisha akuti, ŵalakwe taŵe cenene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo pakwacele kundaŵi kwakwe, Hasaele ŵajigele cakuliwunicila ni ŵaciloŵece m'mesi, ni ŵamwunicile naco mwenye ku meso, nipo mwenye ŵawile. Nipo Hasaele ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'caka camsano ca ucimwene wa Yolamu, mwanace jwa Ahabu mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, Yeholamu, mwanace jwa Yehoshafati mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵatandite kulamulila cilambo ca Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu ŵakwete yaka 32 piŵajinjilaga ucimwene, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka msano ni yitatu ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu ŵakuyisye ndamo syakusakala sya ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli, mpela mulyatendelaga liŵasa lya Ahabu, pakuŵa jwalakwe ŵalombele mwanace jwa Ahabu. Myoyo ŵatesile yakusakala yejinji pameso pa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo AMBUJE nganasaka kucijonanga cilambo ca Yuda, ligongo lya Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwawo, pakuŵa AMBUJE ŵaŵisile cilanga kuti ni jwalakwe kuti jumo jwa mwiŵasa lyakwe tacilamulila ndaŵi syosope cilambo ca Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
