        },
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu piŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵandu ŵa ku Edomu ŵawujimucile ucimwene ŵakwewo, nipo ŵalisagulile mwenye jwawo.",
          "type": "text",
