          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yeholamu ŵajawile pamo ni mageleta gakwe gosope ga ngondo ku Saili, kuŵamsyungulile ŵandu wa ku Edomu pamo ni ŵakulongolela mageleta gakwe. Cilo ŵajitandite kuputa ngondo, nambo ŵalepele. Nipo Yeholamu ni ŵandu ŵa ngondo ŵakwe wosope ŵatisile, ni ŵawujile kumangwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu ŵa ku Edomu ali ŵakwimucila cilambo ca Yuda mpaka lelo jino. Pandaŵi jelejo soni ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Libina ŵamjimucile Yeholamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
