          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'caka ca 12 ca ucimwene wa Yolamu, mwanace jwa Ahabu, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, Ahasiya, mwanace jwa Yeholamu, mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵatandite kulamulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya ŵaliji ni yaka 22 piŵajinjilaga ucimwene, nipo ŵalamulile caka cimope ku Yelusalemu. Lina lya mamagwe lyaliji Ataliya mwanace jwa Ahabu ni cisukulu ca Omuli mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya nombe najo ŵaliji mkukuya ndamo syakusakala sya liŵasa lya Ahabu. Ŵatesile yindu yakusakala pameso pa AMBUJE mpela mulyatendelaga liŵasa lya Ahabu, pakuŵa jwalakweju ŵaliji mkamwini mwiŵasa lilyolyo lya Ahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
