          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahasiya ŵalongene pamo ni Yeholamu, mwanace jwa Ahabu, kuti akamenyane ngondo ni Hasaele, mwenye jwa ku Siliya. Ngondo jawulice ku Lamoti ku Giliyadi, nipo kweleko Asiliya ŵamsomile Yolamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yolamu ŵawujile ni kwawula ku Yesilele, kuti akamposye maŵanga giŵawulele ku ngondo, nipo Ahasiya ŵajawile ku Yesileleko kuja kumsonda Yolamujo, ligongo ŵaliji mkulwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
